# Germaine Training Institute — public site (build10/)
# Custom branded error pages (Phase 4). Without this, a broken link or a
# server hiccup falls through to the hosting provider's bare default error
# page instead of the site's own 404.html / 500.html.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
ErrorDocument 500 /500.html

# Never let a request list a folder's raw file contents.
Options -Indexes

# Extra belt-and-braces rule so no stray dotfile (.env, .git, etc.) is ever
# served if one is accidentally left inside this folder.
<FilesMatch "^\.">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
